      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Dubbed the Walleye Capital of the World, Port Clinton’s waters in Lake Erie’s western basin produce some of the most prolific walleye fishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
